# =====================================================================
# Hummerli — PUBLIC repo. NOTHING secret or personal goes in here.
# Private stuff (sessions, transcripts, evals, audio) lives in:
#   - gs://hummerli-audio-vault/    (GCS)
#   - palladius/hummerli-b1-adk-pvt (private companion repo)
# =====================================================================

